  "coder_notes": "Paediatric-only trial (<3 years; stdAges CHILD), expected to fail S4. Population is high-grade glioma (WHO grade III or IV) and other CNS tumours; glioblastoma is never named, so high_grade_glioma_unspecified. Entry requires NTRK1/2/3 or ROS1 fusion (either), matched to entrectinib. Cyclophosphamide/etoposide/carboplatin are optional bridging chemotherapy before entrectinib, coded soc_backbone (background, not investigational); filgrastim/pegfilgrastim supportive. Regimen coded monotherapy since entrectinib is given alone after optional bridging; adjudicator may prefer combination."
